    "detailed_description": "Human Rights is an interactive lyric video / toy, developed as a companion piece to the song 'Human Rights' by Monster Mansion. Players explore a set of scenes and objects that relate to self expression, while listening to the song, which was inspired by the 2017 Australian same-sex marriage vote.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game was developed almost entirely by the writer/producer of the song, over the first two months of 2019.",
